  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 80 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 4 lbs.</p><p>This sturdy leather case straps to the waist or thigh, or can be slung over a shoulder. It consists of a leather pouch, 5 doses of wolfsbane, 5 doses of weapon blanche (silver), 1 dose of deodorizing agent, and an alchemical silver dagger.</p><hr><p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/equipment#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
